# Subject for tools/check_summoned_feature_expiry.sh, bd inc-rgzr instance 2.
#
# Casts Wall of Doors (lib/wspells.irh), whose doors carry a timed SUMMONED
# stati of 2d6 + caster level turns, then waits well past the longest possible
# duration, reading the message log early and the map at the end. Feature::StatiOff is what removes a summoned
# door when that stati elapses.
#
# The cast drops a column of doors, glyph x, west of the player.
#
# Same opening as tools/keys/light-fog.keys: chargen-mage.keys on seed 1, one
# SPACE for the room description, then wizard mode.
#   w y @choose     wizard mode opens its menu at once; entry "Learn Any Spell", then the name. The
#                   letters move whenever an option is added, so it is chosen
#                   by name.
#   m ENTER         cast the first spell in the list, then aim LEFT.

@include chargen-mage.keys
@dump:arrival

SPACE
w y
@choose "Learn Any Spell"
"Wall of Doors" ENTER
@dump:spell-learned

m ENTER
LEFT ENTER
@dump:doors-cast

# Each search takes about 1500 game ticks, so three searches outlast the longest
# duration. The message log is read now, before 57 more searches push the
# expiry message out of it.
s*3
v
@dump:messages
ESC

s*57
@dump:doors-waited

@quit
